{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55604","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古树交盘簇径深，阒无人到爲难寻。\n只知算计千般事，谁解消停一点心。\n冻锁瀑声中夜断，云吞岳影半天沈。\n寒灯欲绝禅初起，透牖疎风触短襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}